Edit: I normally use summary(model.name <http://model.name>) to call the output, and then simply save the text to a word file before manipulating it.  The printout I get looks like this:

mean     sd 0.025quant 0.5quant 0.975quant     mode kld

Ideally I'd at least like a way to print the data without 0.5quant, mode and kld.

